F. vi and nano editor commands
Nano:
nano file.txt


- Ctrl + O: Save
- Enter: Confirm filename
- Ctrl + X: Exit
- Ctrl + K: Cut line
- Ctrl + U: Paste line
Vi/Vim:
vi file.txt


- i: Insert mode
- Esc: Exit insert mode
- :w: Save
- :q: Quit
- :wq: Save and quit
- :q!: Quit without saving
- dd: Delete a line
- yy: Copy a line
- p: Paste
